OL,3,ANew 10p coin enters circulation - will
OL,4,Ayou spot one?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomething new might appear in your
OL,7,Fchange when you pay in cash from now
OL,8,Fon: a 10p coin featuring the portrait
OL,9,Fof King Charles and the world's largest
OL,10,Fgrouse.
OL,12,FSufficient demand for the coins mean
OL,13,Fnewly-minted 10p pieces are entering
OL,14,Fcirculation for the first time for
OL,15,Fabout four years, this time with a new
OL,16,Fdesign.
OL,18,FThe Royal Mint says shoppers and
OL,19,Fcollectors should discover the coins,
OL,20,Fwhich were minted and dated in 2023 and
OL,21,F2026, across the country.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
